      "actions": null,
      "traits": [
        "acid",
        "aura"
      ],
      "description": "<p>10 feet. Whenever a gutrager is within another xulgath's stench aura, a fog appears around the gutrager; creatures in the fog (including the gutrager) can see as normal, but they are Concealed from creatures outside the fog. Non-xulgaths that begin their turn in the fog take 2d6 Acid Damage damage. Strong winds suppress this ability.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
