      "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The gutrager has 45 or fewer HP</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The gutrager compresses its gut and explodes in a burst of viscera, dying instantly and dealing 8d8 Acid Damage damage to creatures and unattended objects in a 20ft Emanation centered on the gutrager (Basic DC 31 Reflex Saving Throw save).</p>",
