      "name": "Corrosive Kiss",
      "actions": 2,
      "traits": [
        "acid"
      ],
      "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per round</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The gutrager propels its esophagus out of its body to deliver an acidic blow. It makes an unarmed Strike against a creature or unattended object within 30 feet with a +23 attack bonus.</p>\n<p>On a hit, the target takes (2d6+8) Bludgeoning Damage damage plus 4d6 Acid Damage damage.</p>\n<p>On a critical hit, the target also takes 2d6 Persistent,acid Damage damage.</p>\n<p>The gutrager is Clumsy 1 for 1 round as it re-coils its esophagus.</p>",
